<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Testando position</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            height: 1500px;
            background-color: #111;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        h1,
        h2 {
            color: #76f550;
        }

        .card {
            position: relative;
            width: min(90%, 500px);
            padding: 40px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            border: 3px solid #1c2ece;
            background-color: #111;
        }

        .selo-favorito {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            background-color: #FFD700;
            color: #111;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .botao-topo {
            position: fixed;
            right: 25px;
            bottom: 25px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background-color: #008cff;
            color: #111;
            border: 3px solid #ffe600;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .botao-topo:hover {
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .michael-kaiser {
            background-color: #2d5ef0;
            color: #Ffffff;
            border-color: #FFD700;
        }

        .michael-kaiser img {
            border: 5px solid #FFD700;
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .michael-kaiser h2 {
            color: #FFD700;
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow:
                -1px -1px 0 #000,
                1px -1px 0 #000,
                -1px 1px 0 #000,
                1px 1px 0 #000;
        }

        .michael-kaiser p {
            color: #FFD700;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow:
                -1px -1px 0 #000,
                1px -1px 0 #000,
                -1px 1px 0 #000,
                1px 1px 0 #000;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 25px;
            color: #76f550;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body id="topo">
    <header>
        <h1>Aplicando e aprendendo position</h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>Aprendendo a como mexer no position</h2>
        </section>

        <article class="card michael-kaiser">
            <span class="selo-favorito">Meu personagem favorito</span>
            <h2>Michael Kaiser</h2>
            <img src="Imagens/Michael.Kaiser.webp" alt="Michael Kaiser">
            <p>Michael Kaiser o imperador do Bastard München e um dos 11 new gen do blue lock</p>
        </article>

    </main>
    <footer>
        <p class="footer-text">Por hoje foi algo mais simples assim, so aprendendo a mexer com position :)</p>
        <a class="botao-topo" href="#topo">↑ Topo</a>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>